zes ELF, heap, and stack pages directly into their final replacement frames while the old address space remains live. It carries vvar and vDSO into a replacement hierarchy, validates the staged hierarchy with a forced pre-commit failure, switches roots only after preparation succeeds, preserves frames referenced by other processes, and then publishes consistent process metadata. This adds no payload copy; peak memory temporarily contains the old and replacement images.\n\nVerification:\n- make check: passed\n- make test: passed, including forced hierarchy rollback and commit\n- make test-rocky-shell: incomplete before unpack or exec because guest OCI DNS failed on all three registry attempts\n\nThis PR should remain open until the rootfs-specific Rocky integration path runs with a reachable registry or populated cache. Do not merge or close #27 yet.", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:44:51Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-02T04:45:16Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": null, "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "gmkurtzer:hdae/issue-27-transactional-rootfs-exec", "ref": "hdae/issue-27-transactional-rootfs-exec", "repo": {"id": 1413787216, "node_id": "R_kgDOVESuUA", "name": "ginux", "full_name": "gmkurtzer/ginux", "owner": {"login": "gmkurtzer", "id": 13984965, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTg0OTY1", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13984965?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer", "html_url": "https://github.com/gmkurtzer", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtze